1
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:07,650
Black pod is driven by rain.

2
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:13,120
Every year it destroys an estimated twenty to thirty percent of the world's cocoa.

3
00:00:14,360 --> 00:00:16,160
The storm has just stopped.

4
00:00:16,210 --> 00:00:22,750
A Malaysian smallholder has thirty minutes to scout before the disease spreads, and no way to know which block to check first.

5
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:25,720
Memory and habit are all he has.

6
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:30,800
KokoShield.

7
00:00:30,850 --> 00:00:32,700
Weather-guided disease scouting.

8
00:00:32,750 --> 00:00:37,890
Thirty millimetres of rain in twenty-four hours, and the system activates.

9
00:00:38,740 --> 00:00:41,510
A borrowed drone marks where water is standing.

10
00:00:41,560 --> 00:00:50,670
KokoShield combines that with the rain gauge, each block's drainage and past confirmed cases, and in seconds builds a thirty-minute priority route.

11
00:00:50,720 --> 00:00:52,670
Blocks A and G first.

12
00:00:52,720 --> 00:00:54,340
He goes.

13
00:00:55,600 --> 00:01:03,710
And our own Field Node, a 3D-printed sensor concept, adds local temperature and humidity at block level.

14
00:01:06,350 --> 00:01:07,910
Same thirty minutes.

15
00:01:07,960 --> 00:01:11,250
One scout on the usual round, one on the ranked route.

16
00:01:11,300 --> 00:01:16,430
Same time, sharper path, more newly confirmed pods found per hour.

17
00:01:17,890 --> 00:01:19,030
Minute seven.

18
00:01:19,080 --> 00:01:21,480
Brown lesions on a pod in block A.

19
00:01:21,530 --> 00:01:26,220
He photographs it, logs the case for review, and treats only that block.

20
00:01:26,270 --> 00:01:28,990
The rest of the farm stays clean.

21
00:01:31,280 --> 00:01:33,800
Fewer pods lost to a changing climate.

22
00:01:33,850 --> 00:01:35,590
Higher smallholder income.

23
00:01:35,640 --> 00:01:37,240
Food systems that hold.

24
00:01:37,290 --> 00:01:41,480
And the same route planner, ready for rice blast in China.

25
00:01:42,950 --> 00:01:47,430
We're asking for twelve hundred ringgit to complete the first single-farm pilot.

26
00:01:47,480 --> 00:01:48,680
KokoShield.

27
00:01:48,730 --> 00:01:50,950
Find disease sooner after the rain.
